#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md:1132
msgid "$P_{\\mathrm{iMAPLE}} = \\mathrm{Rh} r f_{\\mathrm{ST}} f_{\\mathrm{pH}} f_{\\mathrm{wet}} ( \\mathrm{Yue} \\mathrm{et} \\mathrm{al} . ( 2024 ) \\mathrm{Eq} . 34 )$ with $f_{\\mathrm{ST}}$ from Yue et al. (2024) Eqs. 35-38 (Zhu et al. (2014) Eqs. 3-5 with the temperature-dependent Q10 of Yue et al. (2024) Eq. 39, $\\mathrm{Q}_{10} = \\operatorname{clip} ( r_{b} Q_{b} ^ ( ( \\mathrm{Ts} - T_{\\mathrm{base}} ) / 10 ) , 1.7 , 16 ) , r_{b} = 3.0 , Q_{b} = 1.33 , T_{\\mathrm{base}} = 25 C ; \\mathrm{the} \\operatorname{clip} \\mathrm{is} \\mathrm{the} \\mathrm{observed} \\mathrm{range} \\mathrm{of} \\mathrm{Zhu} \\mathrm{et} \\mathrm{al} . ( 2014 ) \\mathrm{applied} \\mathrm{in} \\mathrm{the} \\mathrm{released} \\mathrm{iMAPLE} \\mathrm{code} )$, $f_{\\mathrm{pH}}$ from Zhu et al. (2014) Eq. 6, and $f_{\\mathrm{wet}}$ the continuous inundation fraction; no closure factor multiplies Eq. 34. The calibrated branch Rh r $f_{T}$ $f_{\\mathrm{Eh}}$ A (the same Zhu et al. (2014) peak $f_{T}$, and the DNDC95 microbial activity index A in [0, 1]) and the blend weight are RELIC conventions with DNDC-type temperature and redox controls, not the DNDC substrate-kinetic model (Fumoto et al. 2008; van Bodegom and Scholten 2001), which is not implemented; its redox factor $f_{\\mathrm{Eh}}$ is the piecewise-linear form of Zhu et al. (2014) Sect. 2.2.1 after Zhang et al. (2002)."
msgstr "$P_{\\mathrm{iMAPLE}} = \\mathrm{Rh} r f_{\\mathrm{ST}} f_{\\mathrm{pH}} f_{\\mathrm{wet}} ( \\mathrm{Yue} \\mathrm{et} \\mathrm{al} . ( 2024 ) \\mathrm{Eq} . 34 )$，其中 $f_{\\mathrm{ST}}$ 来自 Yue et al. (2024) 式 35-38（Zhu et al. (2014) 式 3-5，采用 Yue et al. (2024) 式 39 的温度依赖 Q10，$\\mathrm{Q}_{10} = \\operatorname{clip} ( r_{b} Q_{b} ^ ( ( \\mathrm{Ts} - T_{\\mathrm{base}} ) / 10 ) , 1.7 , 16 ) , r_{b} = 3.0 , Q_{b} = 1.33 , T_{\\mathrm{base}} = 25 C ; \\mathrm{the} \\operatorname{clip} \\mathrm{is} \\mathrm{the} \\mathrm{observed} \\mathrm{range} \\mathrm{of} \\mathrm{Zhu} \\mathrm{et} \\mathrm{al} . ( 2014 ) \\mathrm{applied} \\mathrm{in} \\mathrm{the} \\mathrm{released} \\mathrm{iMAPLE} \\mathrm{code} )$；$f_{\\mathrm{pH}}$ 来自 Zhu et al. (2014) 式 6，$f_{\\mathrm{wet}}$ 为连续淹水比例；式 34 不乘任何闭合因子。校准分支 Rh r $f_{T}$ $f_{\\mathrm{Eh}}$ A（使用同一 Zhu et al. (2014) 峰形 $f_{T}$ 和位于 [0, 1] 的 DNDC95 微生物活性指数 A）及混合权重均为 RELIC 约定，采用 DNDC 类型的温度与氧化还原控制，并非尚未实现的 DNDC 底物动力学模型（Fumoto et al. 2008；van Bodegom and Scholten 2001）；其氧化还原因子 $f_{\\mathrm{Eh}}$ 采用 Zhu et al. (2014) 第 2.2.1 节继承 Zhang et al. (2002) 的分段线性形式。"

