msgid "`0.3; bounds=(0.1, 0.5)`"
msgstr "`0.3; bounds=(0.1, 0.5)`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Width w, in water-filled pore space, of the linear rise of the denitrification anaerobic factor from WFPS_thr to WFPS_thr + w (0.6 to 0.9 with the defaults), f_anoxic = max(clip((WFPS - WFPS_thr)/w, 0, 1), f_min)."
msgstr "反硝化厌氧因子从 WFPS_thr 至 WFPS_thr + w 线性上升的宽度 w，以水填充孔隙比例计（默认值对应 0.6 至 0.9），f_anoxic = max(clip((WFPS - WFPS_thr)/w, 0, 1), f_min)。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Source: relic_convention; RELIC convention value (width of the linear WFPS ramp; no literature value)"
msgstr "来源：relic_convention；RELIC 约定值（WFPS 线性上升段的宽度；无文献数值）"

