msgid "`1e-12; bounds=(0.0, inf)`"
msgstr "`1e-12; bounds=(0.0, inf)`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Lower bound of the denitrification temperature factor f_T = clip(Q10^((T - T_ref)/10), lower, upper) with Q10 = q10_denitrification and T_ref = reference_temperature. With the default Q10 = 2.2 and T_ref = 293.15 K the raw factor reaches 1e-12 only 350 K below T_ref, so the bound never binds at a physical soil temperature; it keeps f_T strictly positive. A floor of the temperature response factor cannot be negative; its upper limit is max_rate_factor, a relation between parameters that bounds cannot express, so the upper bound is open (inf)."
msgstr "反硝化温度因子 f_T = clip(Q10^((T - T_ref)/10), lower, upper) 的下界，其中 Q10 = q10_denitrification，T_ref = reference_temperature。默认 Q10 = 2.2、T_ref = 293.15 K 时，原始因子只有在比 T_ref 低 350 K 时才达到 1e-12，因此该下界在物理土壤温度范围内不会生效；它保持 f_T 严格为正。温度响应因子的下限不能为负；其上限是 max_rate_factor，但这是边界字段无法表达的参数间关系，因此上界开放（inf）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Source: relic_convention; RELIC convention value (temperature factor lower bound; no literature value)"
msgstr "来源：relic_convention；RELIC 约定值（温度因子下界；无文献数值）"

