#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "FunctorMetadata.sub_flow_accuracy ORDER_1 (Hairer, Norsett and Wanner 1993, Sect. II.3) while the donor limit is inactive, $R_{\\mathrm{nit}} \\mathrm{d}t < \\mathrm{NH}_{4}$, i.e. Vmax $f_{T} f_{\\mathrm{O2}} f_{\\mathrm{pH}} \\mathrm{d}t < K_m + \\mathrm{NH}_{4}$; binding on the two coarse grids of CR-A-04 T11 exhausts the numerical pool and yields equal final donor error, while smaller inactive-limit steps recover first order (a finite-step characterization, not a loss of asymptotic convergence)"
msgstr "在供体限制未激活（$R_{\\mathrm{nit}} \\mathrm{d}t < \\mathrm{NH}_{4}$，即 Vmax $f_{T} f_{\\mathrm{O2}} f_{\\mathrm{pH}} \\mathrm{d}t < K_m + \\mathrm{NH}_{4}$）时为 FunctorMetadata.sub_flow_accuracy ORDER_1（Hairer, Norsett and Wanner 1993, Sect. II.3）；在 CR-A-04 T11 的两个粗网格上触发该限制会耗尽数值库并产生相等的最终供体误差，而限制未激活的更小步长可恢复一阶精度（属于有限步长表征，不代表渐近收敛性丧失）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
