msgid "`pedosphere.physical.wfps_nitrification_optimum`"
msgstr "`pedosphere.physical.wfps_nitrification_optimum`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "`0.6; bounds=(0.35, 0.7)`"
msgstr "`0.6; bounds=(0.35, 0.7)`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Water-filled pore space WFPS_opt at which aerobic microbial activity, and with it nitrification, peaks; above it oxygen limits nitrification, f_O2 = max((1 - WFPS)/(1 - WFPS_opt), pedosphere.nitrification.minimum_oxygen_factor), and below it f_O2 = 1. Linn and Doran (1984) found the maximum at 60 percent WFPS with a decline above it through reduced aeration. The bounds are the Bateman and Baggs (2005) range: nitrification is the main N2O source at 35-60 percent WFPS and denitrification produced all N2O at 70 percent."
msgstr "好氧微生物活性及硝化活性达到峰值时的水填充孔隙比例 WFPS_opt；超过该值时氧限制硝化，f_O2 = max((1 - WFPS)/(1 - WFPS_opt), pedosphere.nitrification.minimum_oxygen_factor)，低于该值时 f_O2 = 1。Linn and Doran (1984) 发现最大值位于 60% WFPS，超过后因通气减弱而下降。边界采用 Bateman and Baggs (2005) 的范围：35-60% WFPS 时硝化是主要 N2O 来源，70% 时全部 N2O 来自反硝化。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Source: literature; Linn, D.M. and Doran, J.W. (1984) Effect of water-filled pore space on carbon dioxide and nitrous oxide production in tilled and nontilled soils, Soil Sci. Soc. Am. J. 48, 1267-1272, doi:10.2136/sssaj1984.03615995004800060013x; Bateman, E.J. and Baggs, E.M. (2005) Contributions of nitrification and denitrification to N2O emissions from soils at different water-filled pore space, Biol. Fertil. Soils 41, 379-388, doi:10.1007/s00374-005-0858-3"
msgstr "来源：文献； Linn, D.M. and Doran, J.W. (1984) Effect of water-filled pore space on carbon dioxide and nitrous oxide production in tilled and nontilled soils, Soil Sci. Soc. Am. J. 48, 1267-1272, doi:10.2136/sssaj1984.03615995004800060013x; Bateman, E.J. and Baggs, E.M. (2005) Contributions of nitrification and denitrification to N2O emissions from soils at different water-filled pore space, Biol. Fertil. Soils 41, 379-388, doi:10.1007/s00374-005-0858-3"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "`pedosphere.nitrification.minimum_oxygen_factor`"
msgstr "`pedosphere.nitrification.minimum_oxygen_factor`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Floor of the dimensionless nitrification oxygen response factor, f_O2 = max((1 - WFPS)/(1 - WFPS_opt), f_O2_min) above WFPS_opt = pedosphere.physical.wfps_nitrification_optimum; with the default 0.1 and 0.6 it binds only for WFPS > 0.96."
msgstr "无量纲硝化氧响应因子的下限；当 WFPS 超过 WFPS_opt = pedosphere.physical.wfps_nitrification_optimum 时，f_O2 = max((1 - WFPS)/(1 - WFPS_opt), f_O2_min)。默认下限 0.1、最适值 0.6 时，仅 WFPS > 0.96 才触及下限。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Source: relic_convention; RELIC convention value (oxygen response factor floor; no literature value)"
msgstr "来源：relic_convention；RELIC 约定值（氧响应因子下限；无文献数值）"

