msgid "`pedosphere.nitrification.extreme_temperature_factor`"
msgstr "`pedosphere.nitrification.extreme_temperature_factor`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Multiplier of the nitrification temperature factor f_T outside [temperature_minimum, temperature_maximum]."
msgstr "温度位于 [temperature_minimum, temperature_maximum] 之外时，硝化温度因子 f_T 的乘数。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Source: relic_convention; RELIC convention value (temperature factor multiplier outside the limits; no literature value)"
msgstr "来源：relic_convention；RELIC 约定值（温度界限之外的温度因子乘数；无文献数值）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
