msgstr "`pedosphere.nitrification.temperature_minimum`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "`273.15; bounds=(0.0, inf)`"
msgstr "`273.15; bounds=(0.0, inf)`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Lower soil temperature limit of the nitrification temperature factor: below it f_T is multiplied by extreme_temperature_factor. An absolute (thermodynamic) temperature in K cannot be negative; the lower bound is 0 K."
msgstr "硝化温度因子的土壤温度下限：低于此值时，f_T 乘以 extreme_temperature_factor。以 K 表示的绝对（热力学）温度不能为负，下界为 0 K。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Source: relic_convention; RELIC convention value (temperature factor limit at the freezing point; no literature value)"
msgstr "来源：relic_convention；RELIC 约定值（位于冰点的温度因子界限；无文献数值）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
