msgstr "`323.15; bounds=(0.0, inf)`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Upper soil temperature limit of the nitrification temperature factor (50 degC): above it f_T is multiplied by extreme_temperature_factor. An absolute (thermodynamic) temperature in K cannot be negative; the lower bound is 0 K."
msgstr "硝化温度因子的土壤温度上限（50 degC）：高于此值时，f_T 乘以 extreme_temperature_factor。以 K 表示的绝对（热力学）温度不能为负，下界为 0 K。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
