msgstr "`pedosphere.nitrification.ph_minimum_factor`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Floor of the nitrification pH response factor f_pH = clip(exp(-0.5 ((pH - pH_opt)/w_pH)^2), ph_minimum_factor, 1)."
msgstr "硝化 pH 响应因子 f_pH = clip(exp(-0.5 ((pH - pH_opt)/w_pH)^2), ph_minimum_factor, 1) 的下限。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Source: relic_convention; RELIC convention value (pH response factor floor; no literature value)"
msgstr "来源：relic_convention；RELIC 约定值（pH 响应因子下限；无文献数值）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "`pedosphere.nitrification.min_rate_threshold`"
msgstr "`pedosphere.nitrification.min_rate_threshold`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "`0.001; bounds=(0.0, inf)`"
msgstr "`0.001; bounds=(0.0, inf)`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Lower bound of the nitrification temperature factor f_T = clip(Q10^((T - T_ref)/10) * f_extreme, lower, upper). With the default parameters it binds only below temperature_minimum (273.15 K), where it holds f_T at 0.001. A floor of the temperature response factor cannot be negative; its upper limit is max_rate_factor, a relation between parameters that bounds cannot express, so the upper bound is open (inf)."
msgstr "硝化温度因子 f_T = clip(Q10^((T - T_ref)/10) * f_extreme, lower, upper) 的下界。默认参数下，它只在 temperature_minimum（273.15 K）以下生效，使 f_T 保持为 0.001。温度响应因子的下限不能为负；其上限是 max_rate_factor，但这是边界字段无法表达的参数间关系，因此上界开放（inf）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "`pedosphere.nitrification.max_rate_factor`"
msgstr "`pedosphere.nitrification.max_rate_factor`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "`10.0; bounds=(1.0, 100.0)`"
msgstr "`10.0; bounds=(1.0, 100.0)`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Upper bound of the nitrification temperature factor f_T. With the default parameters it never binds (f_T <= 8 at 323.15 K, and 0.001 times the Q10 term above it), so it is a protective bound; it binds inside the range only when Q10^((T_max - T_ref)/10) > 10, for example Q10 = 2.5 above about 318.3 K."
msgstr "硝化温度因子 f_T 的上界。默认参数下它不生效（323.15 K 时 f_T <= 8，更高温度时为 Q10 项的 0.001 倍），因此是保护性边界；只有 Q10^((T_max - T_ref)/10) > 10 时才会在该区间内生效，例如 Q10 = 2.5 且温度高于约 318.3 K。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "Source: relic_convention; RELIC convention value (temperature factor upper bound; no literature value)"
msgstr "来源：relic_convention；RELIC 约定值（温度因子上界；无文献数值）"

