msgstr "$g ( y , C ) = \\theta C + \\rho_{b} K_{f} C ^ n - y$，其中 $g_{C} = \\theta + \\rho_{b} K_{f} n C ^ ( n - 1 ) > 0 ( \\mathrm{index} 1 )$"

