#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/pedosphere.md
msgid "EquilibriumSorptionFunctor.forward validates states and water content, rejects inconsistent triples, solves the scalar constraint with BracketedBisectionSolver, raises on non-convergence, emits one ACCUMULATE increment, two REPLACE algebraic states, and three REPLACE diagnostics, and reports the total-mass ledger residual through check_conservation_laws."
msgstr "EquilibriumSorptionFunctor.forward 验证状态与含水量，拒绝不一致的三元组，使用 BracketedBisectionSolver 求解标量约束，在不收敛时抛出异常，发出一个 ACCUMULATE 增量、两个 REPLACE 代数状态和三个 REPLACE diagnostics，并通过 check_conservation_laws 报告总质量 ledger 残差。"

