msgstr "theta 加权 storage $x = ( \\theta_{m} c_{m} , \\theta_{\\mathrm{im}} c_{\\mathrm{im}} )$，其中 $H = 0.5 ( \\theta_{m} c_{m} ^ 2 + \\theta_{\\mathrm{im}} c_{\\mathrm{im}} ^ 2 )$"

